---
description: Strict rules for the new Businalyst landing page in frontend/src/landing
globs: frontend/src/landing/**
alwaysApply: false
---

When creating or editing anything under `frontend/src/landing/`, follow every rule in
@frontend/src/landing/.cursorrules exactly, and treat these as required context:

- @frontend/src/landing/brand/BRAND_GUIDELINES.md
- @frontend/src/landing/reference/STACK.md
- @frontend/src/landing/tokens/tokens.css

Never use `frontend/src/pages/LandingPage.jsx` or `frontend/src/pages/landing/**` as a reference.
